<rml>
<head><title>CCCaster</title><link type="text/rcss" href="launcher.rcss" /></head>
<body>
<header class="masthead">
  <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">C</span><div><h1>CCCaster <span>verB</span></h1><p>MELTY BLOOD Actress Again Current Code</p></div></div>
  <span id="version" class="version"></span>
</header>
<div class="shell">
  <nav aria-label="メインメニュー">
    <div class="nav-label">PLAY</div>
    <button class="nav-item active" data-page="matching" aria-current="page" id="nav-matching"><span class="nav-number">01</span><span data-en="Matching">マッチング</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-page="spectate" id="nav-spectate"><span class="nav-number">02</span><span data-en="Spectate">観戦</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-page="training" id="nav-training"><span class="nav-number">03</span><span data-en="Training">トレーニング</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-page="replay" id="nav-replay"><span class="nav-number">04</span><span data-en="Replay">リプレイ観戦</span></button>
    <div class="nav-label second">PREFERENCES</div>
    <button class="nav-item" data-page="settings" id="nav-settings"><span class="nav-number">05</span><span data-en="Profile &amp; settings">プロフィール・設定</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-page="guide" id="nav-guide"><span class="nav-number">06</span><span data-en="How to play">操作ガイド</span></button>
    <div class="nav-bottom"><button id="language" class="quiet">English</button><p>MBAACC 1.07<br />Rev.1.4.0</p></div>
  </nav>
  <main id="content">
    <div id="loading" class="notice" role="status" data-en="Preparing the launcher…">ランチャーを準備しています…</div>
    <div id="error" class="notice error hidden" role="alert"></div>
    <div id="incoming-banner" class="notice incoming hidden"><div><strong data-en="Incoming match request">対戦の申し込みが届いています</strong><p data-en="Open matching to accept or decline.">マッチング画面から承諾・お断りを選べます。</p></div><button id="show-requests" data-en="View requests">申し込みを確認</button><button id="dismiss-notice" class="quiet" data-en="Dismiss">閉じる</button></div>

    <section class="page" id="page-matching">
      <div class="page-heading matching-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">MATCH LOBBY</p><h2 data-en="Find your next match">対戦相手を見つける</h2><p class="subtle" data-en="Choose a player, or open your own listing and wait for a request.">相手を選んで申し込む。自分で募集して、申し込みを待つ。</p></div></div>
      <div class="tabs matching-tabs" role="tablist"><button id="matching-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-en="Public matching">公開マッチング</button><button id="direct-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-en="Direct connection">直接接続</button></div>
        <div id="requests-card" class="card request-card hidden"><h3 data-en="Incoming requests">届いた申し込み</h3><div id="requests"></div></div>
        <div id="outgoing" class="card hidden"><p id="outgoing-text"></p><button id="cancel-request" data-en="Cancel request">申し込みを取り消す</button></div>
        <button id="cancel-pairing" data-en="Cancel pairing" class="hidden">成立確認を中止</button>
        <p id="matching-notice" class="subtle hidden" role="status"></p><p id="matching-error" class="error-text hidden"></p>
      <div id="matching-panel" role="tabpanel">
        <div class="matching-layout">
          <div id="public-directory" class="card directory-card">
            <div class="directory-heading"><p class="eyebrow">PUBLIC PLAYERS</p><div class="card-title"><h3 data-en="Public matching list">公開マッチング一覧</h3><span id="people-count" class="count-badge"></span></div><div class="directory-status"><span class="subtle" data-en="Updates automatically">一覧を自動取得</span><span id="service-status" class="pill" role="status"></span></div></div>
            <p id="incomplete" class="error-text hidden" data-en="The history limit was reached; this list may be incomplete.">取得上限に達したため、一覧は一部のみです。</p>
            <div id="people-window" class="people-window"><div id="people"></div></div>
            <div class="pagination"><button id="prev" data-en="Previous">前へ</button><span id="page-count"></span><button id="next" data-en="Next">次へ</button></div>
            <div class="player-selection"><p id="selected-player" class="subtle"></p><p id="selected-result" class="error-text hidden"></p><div class="selection-actions"><button id="invite-selected" data-en="Request a match">対戦申し込み</button><button id="watch-selected" data-en="Watch / stand by">観戦・待機</button></div></div>
            <p class="directory-note" data-en="20 players per page. A listing does not guarantee availability; ask by sending a request.">1ページ20名。掲載中でも対戦中の場合があります。申し込みへの返答で確認してください。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card registration" id="registration-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">YOUR STANDBY</p><h3 id="standby-title">公開で対戦を待つ</h3>
            <div class="standby-profile"><span class="profile-mark">P</span><div><strong id="matching-name"></strong><p id="matching-status" class="subtle" role="status"></p></div></div>
            <p id="visibility-help" class="subtle"></p>
            <div id="registration-start"><button id="start-matching" class="primary standby-start">公開マッチング待機開始</button><details id="matching-options"><summary id="matching-options-toggle" class="summary" data-en="Connection options">接続オプション</summary><label><span data-en="UDP port">接続ポート</span><input id="matching-port" type="text" min="1" max="65535" value="7500" /></label></details></div>
            <div id="registration-active" class="hidden"><span id="registration-visibility" class="pill"></span><div class="code-line"><strong id="matching-code" class="code"></strong><button id="copy-matching" data-en="Copy code">コードをコピー</button></div><p class="subtle" data-en="This code works for matches and spectating. It stays the same after a match.">対戦・観戦に共通のコードです。対戦後も同じコードで待受へ戻ります。</p><label class="check"><input id="pause-matching" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Pause incoming requests">受付を一時停止</span></label><button id="switch-visibility" class="standby-switch hidden"></button><button id="stop-matching" class="quiet standby-stop" data-en="End standby">待機を終了</button></div>
            <p id="other-mode" class="subtle hidden" data-en="Incoming matches are paused while another mode is running.">別モードの実行中は対戦の受付を休止しています。</p>
            <div class="standby-guide"><span class="step-number">1</span><span data-en="Start standby">待機を開始</span><span class="step-number">2</span><span data-en="Accept a request to play">申し込みを承諾して対戦</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="direct-panel" role="tabpanel" class="hidden">
        <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Connect with a code">接続コードで対戦</h3><p id="end-matching-hint" class="subtle hidden" data-en="You can request a matching code while listed. End matching before starting a direct session or changing the port.">公開待機中もマッチングコードへ申し込めます。直接待受・直接接続やポート変更の前には、待機を終了してください。</p>
          <fieldset id="direct-fields"><label><span data-en="Connection code (leave blank to host)">接続コード（空欄なら待受）</span><input id="direct-code" maxlength="511" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" /></label><label class="port"><span data-en="Local UDP port">接続ポート</span><input id="direct-port" type="text" min="1" max="65535" value="7500" /></label>
          <p class="subtle" data-en="Leave the code blank to wait on this port. Enter a code to connect; matching codes are accepted here too.">コードが空欄なら、指定したポートで待ち受けます。コードを入力すると、その相手へ接続します。マッチング用のコードも同じ欄で使えます。</p>
          <button id="start-direct" class="primary" data-en="Confirm">決定</button></fieldset>
          <p id="direct-lookup" class="subtle hidden" role="status" data-en="Checking the connection code…">接続コードを確認しています…</p>
          <p class="subtle" data-en="Automatic LAN / IPv6 / IPv4 connection. Your opponent can see your IP address.">LAN・IPv6・IPv4で自動接続します。対戦相手にIPアドレスが伝わります。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page hidden" id="page-spectate"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WATCH THE MATCH</p><h2 data-en="Spectate">観戦</h2></div></div><div class="card feature"><h3 data-en="A place for every spectator">大会も、仲間の対戦も</h3><p data-en="Enter either player’s matching code. You can stand by before the match starts; the game launches when both players allow watching and the connection is ready.">どちらかの対戦者のマッチングコードで、対戦開始前から待機できます。双方が観戦を許可し、接続の準備が整うと自動でゲームを起動します。</p><label><span data-en="Spectator code">観戦コード</span><input id="spectator-code" maxlength="255" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" /></label><button id="watch" class="primary launch" data-en="Watch / stand by">観戦する・開始まで待機</button><p class="subtle" data-en="Direct connection codes also work. Spectating requires TCP reachability. Up to 8 viewers; ends when this pairing ends.">直接接続のコードも使用できます。観戦にはTCPの到達性が必要です。最大8人。一組の対戦が終了すると観戦も終了します。</p></div></section>
    <section class="page hidden" id="page-training"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">BUILD YOUR NEXT MOVE</p><h2 data-en="Training">トレーニング</h2></div><span class="pill" data-en="Offline">オフライン</span></div><div class="card feature"><h3 data-en="Take time to practice">自分のペースで、次の一手を。</h3><p data-en="Start as Player 1 without an opponent or a connection code.">対戦相手や接続コードなしで、1Pとして練習を始められます。</p><button id="training" class="primary launch" data-en="Start training">トレーニングを開始</button><div class="tips"><p><kbd>F4</kbd><span data-en="Controller settings">コントローラ設定</span></p><p><kbd>Ctrl + 0–8</kbd><span data-en="Change input delay during practice">練習中の入力ディレイを変更</span></p><p><kbd>F1</kbd><span data-en="Cycle HUD: normal / detailed / hidden (frame bar in detailed mode)">HUDを通常／詳細／非表示に切替（詳細にフレームバー）</span></p><p><kbd>FN1 / FN2</kbd><span data-en="Save / load a practice state">練習状態の保存／読込み</span></p></div></div></section>
    <section class="page hidden" id="page-replay"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">LOOK BACK. MOVE FORWARD.</p><h2 data-en="Replay">リプレイ観戦</h2></div></div><div class="card feature"><h3 data-en="Review your saved matches">あの対戦を、もう一度。</h3><p data-en="Open the game’s standard ReplayVS list. Directions and A select a replay; B goes back. F4 opens controller settings.">ゲーム標準のReplayVS一覧を開きます。方向入力とAで選択・再生、Bで戻ります。F4でコントローラを設定できます。</p><button id="replay" class="primary launch" data-en="Open replay list">リプレイ一覧を開く</button><p class="subtle" data-en="Online matches are saved automatically after the result is confirmed. F1 cycles normal, detailed (frame bar) and hidden HUD during playback.">ネット対戦の結果確定時に自動保存します。再生中のF1でHUDを通常／詳細（フレームバー）／非表示に切り替えられます。</p></div></section>

    <section class="page hidden" id="page-settings"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">MAKE IT YOURS</p><h2 data-en="Profile &amp; settings">プロフィール・設定</h2></div></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Player profile">プレイヤー情報</h3><fieldset id="profile-fields"><label><span data-en="Player name">プレイヤー名</span><input id="player-name" maxlength="31" autocomplete="off" /></label><p class="subtle" data-en="Up to 31 ASCII characters. Saved when you leave the field; applied to the next match.">半角英数字・記号31文字まで。欄を離れると保存し、次の対戦から反映します。</p><div class="row"><img id="emblem" width="96" height="48" aria-label="エンブレム" src="emblem:0" /><div class="grow"><button id="emblem-choose" data-en="Choose BMP">BMPを選択</button><button id="emblem-remove" class="quiet" data-en="Remove">削除</button><p class="subtle" data-en="24 x 12 px (2:1), 24-bit uncompressed BMP (.bmp). 288 pixels. Saved immediately without resizing.">幅24×高さ12px（2:1）・24bit非圧縮BMP（.bmp）・288ピクセル。サイズを変えずに自動保存します。</p></div></div><details id="emblem-preset-details"><summary id="emblem-preset-toggle" data-en="Flag presets (24)">国旗プリセット（24種類）</summary><div class="details-body"><p class="subtle" data-en="Simplified flag designs in 24 x 12 pixels. Select one to save it immediately.">各国の国旗を24×12pxで模した図柄です。選択すると自動保存します。</p><div id="emblem-presets"></div></div></details></fieldset><p id="profile-error" class="error-text hidden" data-en="Could not load the saved emblem.">保存済みエンブレムを読み込めませんでした。</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Connection">接続</h3><label><span data-en="Connection priority">接続方式の優先</span><select id="connection-preference"><option value="0" data-en="Automatic (LAN / IPv6 / IPv4)">自動（LAN／IPv6／IPv4）</option><option value="1" data-en="Prefer IPv4">IPv4優先</option><option value="2" data-en="Prefer IPv6">IPv6優先</option></select></label><label class="check"><input id="allow-spectators" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Allow spectators">観戦を許可する</span></label><p class="subtle" data-en="Both players must allow watching. Change this before requesting a match.">観戦には双方の許可が必要です。申し込み前に変更してください。</p><details><summary data-en="Notification service" class="summary">通知サービス</summary><label><span>ntfy</span><input id="ntfy-server" type="text" maxlength="255" /></label><button id="save-server" data-en="Save server">通知先を保存</button></details></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Incoming notifications">着信通知</h3><label class="check"><input id="sound" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Play notification sound">通知音を鳴らす</span></label><label class="check"><input id="flash" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Flash taskbar button">タスクバーを点滅</span></label><label class="check"><input id="popup" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Show desktop popup">画面の隅に通知を表示</span></label><button id="test-notification" data-en="Test notification">通知を試す</button><p class="subtle" data-en="The popup closes after 10 seconds without taking keyboard focus.">操作中の画面は切り替えません。通知は10秒で閉じます。</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Display">表示</h3><label class="check"><input id="software-rendering" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Use CPU rendering on next launch">次回起動からCPUで描画する</span></label><p class="subtle" data-en="If the screen cannot be displayed, choose CPU rendering from the window’s Display menu (F8). Background drawing pauses while a game is running.">画面が表示されない場合は、ウィンドウ上部「表示」メニューからCPU描画へ切り替えられます（F8）。ゲーム実行中は背面の画面描画を休止します。</p><span id="renderer-status" class="pill"></span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="page hidden" id="page-guide"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">READY TO PLAY</p><h2 data-en="How to play">操作ガイド</h2></div></div><div class="card"><h3 data-en="Getting started">はじめに</h3><p data-en="Place the entire cccaster_B folder beside MBAA.exe, Start Training first and configure your controller with F4.">cccaster_Bフォルダー全体をMBAA.exeの隣へ配置します。まずはトレーニングを起動し、F4でコントローラを設定してください。</p><p data-en="Select a name in Public matching, or enter a code in Direct connection. Leave the code blank to host. Matching requests connect after acceptance and return to the same code when the session ends.">公開マッチングの一覧から相手を選ぶか、直接接続の画面でコードを入力します。コードが空欄なら待受を開始します。マッチングの申し込みは承諾後に接続し、対戦後も同じコードで待受へ戻ります。</p></div><div class="card"><h3 data-en="Game controls">ゲーム中の操作</h3><div class="tips"><p><kbd>F4</kbd><span data-en="Controller settings; press again to save and close.">コントローラ設定。もう一度押すと保存して閉じます。</span></p><p><kbd>A / B</kbd><span data-en="Confirm / back (your configured buttons). B is blocked before a character is selected.">決定／戻る（割り当てたボタン）。キャラ未選択時のBは無効です。</span></p><p><kbd>Ctrl + 0–8</kbd><span data-en="Change delay D at character select; also available during offline practice.">入力ディレイDをキャラ選択中に変更。オフライン練習中も変更できます。</span></p><p><kbd>ROLLBACK</kbd><span data-en="Rollback is managed automatically.">ロールバックは自動調整します。</span></p><p><kbd>F1</kbd><span data-en="Cycle HUD: normal / detailed / hidden. Detailed mode includes the frame bar during training, spectating and replay.">HUDを通常／詳細／非表示に切替。練習・観戦・リプレイの詳細モードにフレームバーを表示。</span></p><p><kbd>FN1</kbd><span data-en="Training: save once, freeze while held, then resume on release.">練習：状態を1回保存。押している間は両キャラ停止、離すと再開。</span></p><p><kbd>FN2</kbd><span data-en="DUMMY loads directly. Recording loads and restarts recording. Otherwise, reset then load. Without a save, use the normal reset.">ダミーは直接ロード。録画中はロードして録り直し。それ以外はリセット後にロード。保存がなければ通常リセット。</span></p><p><kbd>Alt + Enter</kbd><span data-en="Toggle borderless fullscreen.">ボーダーレス全画面の切替。</span></p></div><p class="subtle" data-en="Training has one temporary save slot, cleared when you leave battle.">練習用の保存は一時的な1枠です。戦闘を離れると消去されます。</p></div><div class="card"><h3 data-en="After a match">対戦後</h3><p data-en="Both players choose ONCE AGAIN to rematch. Either player choosing CHARACTER SELECT returns both players to character select.">双方がONCE AGAINを選ぶと再戦。片側がCHARACTER SELECTを選ぶと、双方がキャラ選択に戻ります。</p><p data-en="Confirmed results save a standard .rep file to ReplayVS automatically. Filenames include the date, names and [WIN] or [UNDECIDED]. Emblems are not stored in replays.">結果確定時に標準.repをReplayVSへ自動保存。ファイル名には日時・両者名と[WIN]または[UNDECIDED]を付けます。エンブレムはリプレイに保存しません。</p></div></section>

    <section id="session-card" class="card session-card hidden" aria-label="接続状況"><div class="card-title"><h3 data-en="Session">接続状況</h3><span id="session-badge" class="pill"></span></div><p id="session-status" role="status"></p><div id="routes" class="subtle"></div><div id="share-code" class="code-line hidden"><strong id="session-code" class="code"></strong><button id="copy-session" data-en="Copy code">コードをコピー</button></div><button id="copy-watch" data-en="Copy spectator code" class="hidden">観戦コードをコピー</button><details id="manual" class="hidden"><summary data-en="Manual code exchange" class="summary">手動コード交換</summary><p class="subtle" data-en="Send the host code to the guest; return the guest’s reply to the host.">募集側のコードを参加者へ送り、参加者の返信コードを募集側へ返してください。</p><textarea id="manual-code" readonly="" rows="3"></textarea><button id="copy-manual" data-en="Copy manual code">手動コードをコピー</button><div id="manual-host"><label><span data-en="Guest reply">参加側の返信コード</span><input id="manual-peer" maxlength="400" spellcheck="false" /></label><button id="use-reply" data-en="Connect with reply">返信コードで接続</button></div><button id="manual-start" data-en="Start manual connection together">タイミングを合わせて手動接続を開始</button></details><button id="cancel-session" data-en="Cancel connection / standby">接続・待機をキャンセル</button></section>
    <details id="log-details" class="log-details"><summary data-en="Detailed session log" class="summary">接続の詳細ログ</summary><pre id="session-log"></pre></details>
    <footer><span data-en="F4 — controller settings in game">F4 — ゲーム内でコントローラ設定</span><span id="netplay-settings"></span></footer>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
